==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
*5 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*2 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Teacher Bear]] spawns as the boss.
**6 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
**3 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
**1 [[Kang Roo]] spawns after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

